WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.867
Maria pays for her kids' swim lessons, and she gives to your annual campaign. But your systems see two different people.

2
00:00:07.317 --> 00:00:11.958
Ardn brings membership and fundraising together. One community. One record.

3
00:00:12.408 --> 00:00:18.069
Every morning, see members, revenue, donations, and check-ins, across every branch, on one screen.

4
00:00:18.519 --> 00:00:23.851
Families live in one household, with billing split any way they need, even between two parents.

5
00:00:24.901 --> 00:00:30.381
At the front desk, one scan checks in members, guests, and walk-ins, even at the busiest hour.

6
00:00:30.831 --> 00:00:35.448
Members book classes, camps, and swim lessons online, and waitlists fill themselves.

7
00:00:36.498 --> 00:00:42.094
Run campaigns right beside membership. Every gift lands on the same record as the family who gave it.

8
00:00:43.144 --> 00:00:47.793
And when the board asks how each branch is doing, the answer takes seconds, not a spreadsheet.

9
00:00:48.843 --> 00:00:58.457
We never take a percentage of your revenue. Payments go straight to your own account. Try a free pilot in your own branding, and go live in sixty days, or your money back.

10
00:00:58.907 --> 00:01:03.228
One community. One record. Start your free pilot with Ardn today.
